---
title: Cuba Libre
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, rum]
source: Classic cocktail, number 43 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

Fill a #highball glass{} with ice. Squeeze in @lime juice{0.5%fl_oz}, add @white rum{2%fl_oz}, and top with @cola{4%fl_oz}. Stir gently and garnish with a @lime{1%wedge}.
